edia.org/w/index.php?title=3DGam%C3%A3o&amp;action=3Dedit&amp;section=3D15"=
 title=3D"Editar c=C3=B3digo-fonte da sec=C3=A7=C3=A3o: Praticantes famosos=
 e impacto cultural"><span>editar c=C3=B3digo-fonte</span></a><span class=
=3D"mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<figure typeof=3D"mw:File/Thumb"><a href=3D"https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/F=
icheiro:Wurfzabel.jpg" class=3D"mw-file-description"><img src=3D"https://up=
